{"data":{"product":{"id":"gid://shopify/Product/7535944368225","title":"Powder Blue Mommy and Me Set — Flutter Top & Eyelet Pants","handle":"powder-blue-mommy-and-me-set","status":"ACTIVE","publishedAt":"2026-04-23T15:07:10Z","onlineStoreUrl":"https://www.dresslikemommy.com/products/powder-blue-mommy-and-me-set","descriptionHtml":"<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight woven set with an airy flutter top and embroidered eyelet pants for breezy summer wear.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A coastal-ready matching set for mom and daughter, made for beach walks, vacations, and photo days.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> \"Powder Blue\" pairs a soft sky-blue top with crisp white eyelet wide-leg pants.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Adjustable spaghetti straps, a floaty ruffle hem, scalloped eyelet pants, and an easy pull-on waistband.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, line dry, do not bleach, and use a cool iron on the reverse if needed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Girls Child 3 Years to Child 9-10 Years; Mother S to Mother M.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart — Top &amp; Pants Set</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n      <th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Sleeve or Skirt (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Pant/Short or — (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>14–16 kg / 31–35 lbs</td>\n<td>95–105 cm / 37–41 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<td>44 cm / 17.3 in</td>\n<td>56 cm / 22.0 in</td>\n<td>76 cm / 29.9 in</td>\n<td>44 cm / 17.3 in</td>\n<td>44 cm / 17.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>16–19 kg / 35–42 lbs</td>\n<td>105–115 cm / 41–45 in</td>\n<td>76 cm / 29.9 in</td>\n<td>48 cm / 18.9 in</td>\n<td>61 cm / 24.0 in</td>\n<td>80 cm / 31.5 in</td>\n<td>46 cm / 18.1 in</td>\n<td>48 cm / 18.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>19–22 kg / 42–49 lbs</td>\n<td>115–125 cm / 45–49 in</td>\n<td>80 cm / 31.5 in</td>\n<td>51 cm / 20.1 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>49 cm / 19.3 in</td>\n<td>51 cm / 20.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6–7</td>\n<td>22–27 kg / 49–60 lbs</td>\n<td>125–135 cm / 49–53 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>54 cm / 21.3 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>52 cm / 20.5 in</td>\n<td>54 cm / 21.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>27–32 kg / 60–71 lbs</td>\n<td>135–145 cm / 53–57 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>59 cm / 23.2 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>55 cm / 21.7 in</td>\n<td>59 cm / 23.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9–10</td>\n<td>32–38 kg / 71–84 lbs</td>\n<td>145–155 cm / 57–61 in</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>64 cm / 25.2 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n<td>64 cm / 25.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>50–57 kg / 110–125 lbs</td>\n<td>155–163 cm / 61–64 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<td>91 cm / 35.8 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>65 cm / 25.6 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>57–64 kg / 125–141 lbs</td>\n<td>160–168 cm / 63–66 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1 in</td>\n<td>93 cm / 36.6 in</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Bring a little seaside calm to your matching-moment wardrobe with the Powder Blue Mommy and Me Set. The floaty top skims softly away from the body for an airy feel, while the bright white eyelet pants add texture, movement, and a vacation-ready finish. From beach houses to boardwalk photos, it delivers that dressed-up-without-trying look in one easy pairing.</p>\n\n<p>The styling is playful but polished: adjustable straps, a soft flutter hem, scalloped eyelet pants, and a relaxed fit that moves comfortably through warm-weather plans. Wear it for resort dinners, family photos, brunch by the water, or any day you want your mom-and-mini look to feel fresh, light, and picture-perfect.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Airy summer feel:</strong> Lightweight woven textures keep the set comfortable on sunny days.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Photo-ready contrast:</strong> Powder blue and crisp white create a fresh coastal palette.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Two-piece versatility:</strong> Style the flutter top and eyelet pants together or mix them with closet basics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Adjustable comfort:</strong> Straps and an easy waistband help each size wear comfortably.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom + mini matching:</strong> Both roles share the same soft resort-ready silhouette for easy twinning.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Add your sizes and make the next beach day, vacation dinner, or family photo feel instantly coordinated.</p>","tags":["Beach","Blue","Child 2-3yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Dresses","Eyelet","Flutter Top","Girl Dress","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1034212252780.html","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Dresses","Matching Family Outfits","Mom Size M","Mom Size S","Mommy and Me","Mother Dress","Mother M","Mother S","Powder Blue","Resort","Ruffle","Scalloped","Sleeveless Dress","Summer","Summer Dresses","Summer Matching Outfit","Sundresses","Vacation","White","Wide-Leg Pants"],"seo":{"title":"Powder Blue Mommy & Me Set | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Lightweight woven mommy-and-me set with a flutter top and eyelet pants for mom + daughter. Sizes 3Y–10Y and Mom S–M."},"category":{"id":"gid://shopify/TaxonomyCategory/aa-1-11","fullName":"Apparel & Accessories > Clothing > Outfit Se